BugInfo.Description:
一个可序列化的类反序列化调用`readObject()`方法时，并不会调用该类中的构造函数。因此，如果可序列化类的构造函数中存在SecurityManager检查，而在`readObject()`和`readObjectNoData()`方法中又没有进行相同的SecurityManager检查，此类进行反序列化时将会绕过此安全检查。  

**例如**：对于下列代码，构造函数中包含SecurityManager检查，而`readObject()`和`readObjectNoData()`方法中不包含该检查。  
```java
import java.io.IOException;  
import java.io.ObjectInputStream;  
import java.io.Serializable;  
import java.security.Permission;  
public class BadSecurityCheck implements Serializable {  
    private String name;  
    public SecurityCheck(String name) {  
        SecurityManager smanger= System.getSecurityManager();  
        if (smanger!= null) {  
            smanger.checkPermission(new BadPermission("SecurityCheck"));  
        }  
        this.name = name;  
    }  
    public void readObject(ObjectInputStream input) throws ClassNotFoundException,IOException {  
        input.defaultReadObject();  
    }  
    public void readObjectNoData(ObjectInputStream input) throws ClassNotFoundException, IOException {  
        input.defaultReadObject();  
    }  
}
```

BugInfo.Advice:
如果可序列化类的构造函数中存在SecurityManager检查，则`readObject()`和`readObjectNoData()`方法中必须存在相同的SecurityManager检查。  

**例如**：下列代码在构造函数与`readObject()`和`readObjectNoData()`方法中都使用`doSecurityCheck()`方法来执行SecurityManager检查。  
```java
import java.io.IOException;  
import java.io.ObjectInputStream;  
import java.io.Serializable;      
public class GoodSecurityCheck implements Serializable {  
    private String name;  
    public SecurityCheck(String name) {  
        SecurityManager smanger= System.getSecurityManager();  
        if (smanger!= null) {  
            smanger.checkPermission(new BadPermission("SecurityCheck"));  
        }  
        this.name = name;  
    }  
    public void readObject(ObjectInputStream input) throws ClassNotFoundException,IOException {  
        input.defaultReadObject();  
        doSecurityCheck();  
    }  
    public void readObjectNoData(ObjectInputStream input) throws ClassNotFoundException, IOException {  
        input.defaultReadObject();  
        doSecurityCheck();  
    }  
    private final void doSecurityCheck() {  
        SecurityManager sm = System.getSecurityManager();  
        if (sm != null) {  
            sm.checkPermission(new GoodPermission("SecurityCheck"));  
        }  
    }  
}
```
